uropean name is after Cook", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T23:04:30Z", "username": "pratik.s.chandarana", "text": "Yes that was my hint", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T23:04:37Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Maori one is Aoraki?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T23:04:39Z", "username": "pratik.s.chandarana", "text": "Mount cook is its European name", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]